<urn:anqr:profile-disposition:bau:1> <urn:usf:predicate:subsumptionEvidence> "Derived on 2026-09-03 from the contract-selection lattice over all nine declared RealisationProfiles. Contract-set containment is the objective relation: where profile A's selectsContract set is a strict subset of profile B's, B carries every obligation A selects. The chain is v3-semantic-first:1 (1 contract) subset of v3-self-host:1 (5) subset of v3-self-host:2 (6) subset of v3-self-host-hermes:1 (7) subset of urn:anqr:profile:hermes-bau:1 (8), with urn:anqr:profile:decoded-payload-bootstrap:1 (1) subset of urn:anqr:profile:bau:1 (7) subset of hermes-bau:1. v3-self-host:3 (12 contracts, nine of them selected by nothing else) is not in that chain: it is a re-selection onto the provider pipeline and the only policy-covered lane. v3-semantic-recovery:1 owns semantic-recovery-exchange:1 uniquely and is subsumed by nothing." <urn:anqr:graph:profile> .
<urn:anqr:profile-disposition:bau:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:ProfileDisposition> <urn:anqr:graph:profile> .
