<urn:anqr:profile-disposition:hermes-bau:1> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionBasis> "The maximum of the composition chain and the fullest ANQR work lane. It is policy-uncovered and therefore cannot record completion, but ANQR product realisation does not route through it: the product binds urn:anqr:profile-foundation-binding:1 to urn:anqr:profile-revision:1 and reads 39 of 39 capabilities fully satisfied through the facet mechanism on graph/products/anqr/manifest.json. Its uncovered state is therefore not an ANQR realisation gap." <urn:anqr:graph:profile> .
