<urn:anqr:profile-disposition:hermes-bau:1> <urn:usf:predicate:subsumptionEvidence> "The product BAU lane strictly contains urn:usf:profile:v3-self-host-hermes:1, adding only anqr-decoded-payload:1. The containment is recorded here rather than in the foundation because the core layer may not name a product: the product-to-core direction binds the opposite layer identity, never the reverse." <urn:anqr:graph:profile> .
